  "Velocidad": "Speed",
  "4 mm/s": "4 mm/s",
  "Recarga la página de mods (<code>F5</code>): el grafo vuelve a su estado inicial. En el primer bloque, <strong>read SVG</strong>, pulsa <strong>select SVG file</strong> para importar un SVG.": "Reload the mods page (<code>F5</code>): the graph goes back to its initial state. In the first block, <strong>read SVG</strong>, click <strong>select SVG file</strong> to import an SVG.",
  "Nodo read SVG vacío con el botón select SVG file": "Empty read SVG node with the select SVG file button",
  "Clic en select SVG file": "Click select SVG file",
  "Nodo read SVG: botón select SVG file": "read SVG node: select SVG file button",
  "Elige el SVG de la periferia (<code>PERIFERIA</code>) y pulsa <strong>Abrir</strong>. El orden en que se procesan los tres archivos no importa: lo que cuenta es terminar con los tres <code>.rml</code>.": "Choose the outline SVG (<code>PERIFERIA</code>) and click <strong>Open</strong> (<strong>Abrir</strong>). The order in which the three files are processed does not matter: what counts is ending up with the three <code>.rml</code> files.",
  "Diálogo Abrir de Windows con el archivo PERIFERIA seleccionado": "Windows Open dialog with the PERIFERIA file selected",
  "Elegir PERIFERIA": "Choose PERIFERIA",
  "Abrir": "Open",
  "Diálogo Abrir: PERIFERIA": "Open dialog: PERIFERIA",
  "Debe verse el contorno octagonal cargado, tanto en <strong>read SVG</strong> como en <strong>convert SVG image</strong>.": "The octagonal outline should be loaded, both in <strong>read SVG</strong> and in <strong>convert SVG image</strong>.",
  "read SVG y convert SVG image con el contorno octagonal de PERIFERIA cargado": "read SVG and convert SVG image with the PERIFERIA octagonal outline loaded",
  "PERIFERIA cargada en read SVG y convert SVG image": "PERIFERIA loaded in read SVG and convert SVG image",
  "En <strong>set PCB defaults</strong> cambia el interruptor a <strong>mm</strong>…": "In <strong>set PCB defaults</strong> switch to <strong>mm</strong>…",
  "Nodo set PCB defaults con el interruptor in/mm": "set PCB defaults node with the in/mm switch",
  "Cambiar a mm": "Change to mm",
  "set PCB defaults: interruptor in / mm": "set PCB defaults: in / mm switch",
  "…y selecciona <strong>1.59mm cutout</strong> (la fresa para cortar el contorno).": "…and select <strong>1.59mm cutout</strong> (the end mill for cutting the outline).",
  "set PCB defaults con 1.59mm cutout seleccionado": "set PCB defaults with 1.59mm cutout selected",
  "Elegir 1.59mm cutout": "Choose 1.59mm cutout",
  "Preset 1.59mm cutout": "Preset 1.59mm cutout",
  "En <strong>mill raster 2D</strong> pon <strong>tool diameter</strong> en <code>1.9</code> mm (primera opción, el campo en mm) y <strong>offset number</strong> en <code>2</code>. Cut depth (0.254 mm) y max depth (1.7018 mm) ya vienen del preset.": "In <strong>mill raster 2D</strong> set <strong>tool diameter</strong> to <code>1.9</code> mm (first option, the mm field) and <strong>offset number</strong> to <code>2</code>. Cut depth (0.254 mm) and max depth (1.7018 mm) already come from the preset.",
  "Nodo mill raster 2D con tool diameter 1.9 mm y offset number 2": "mill raster 2D node with tool diameter 1.9 mm and offset number 2",
  "Poner 1.9 mm": "Set 1.9 mm",
  "Offset number = 2": "Offset number = 2",
  "mill raster 2D: tool diameter 1.9 mm, offset number 2": "mill raster 2D: tool diameter 1.9 mm, offset number 2",
  "En <strong>Roland SRM-20 milling machine</strong> marca el <strong>origin</strong> en <code>0, 0, 0</code> (por defecto viene 10, 10, 10). Deja <strong>speed</strong> en 4 mm/s. <br><br>Si necesitaras fabricar otra placa en la misma máquina y en la misma fenólica al mismo tiempo, en el segundo archivo cambia X o Y del origen según las medidas de tu placa para no encimarlas y aprovechar el espacio. Aquí es una sola placa, así que 0 en todo.": "In <strong>Roland SRM-20 milling machine</strong> set the <strong>origin</strong> to <code>0, 0, 0</code> (the default is 10, 10, 10). Leave <strong>speed</strong> at 4 mm/s. <br><br>If you needed to make another board on the same machine and on the same FR-1 sheet at the same time, in the second file change the origin X or Y according to the size of your board so they do not overlap and the space is used well. Here it is a single board, so 0 everywhere.",
  "Roland SRM-20": "Roland SRM-20",
  "Nodo Roland SRM-20 milling machine con origin 10, 10, 10 por defecto": "Roland SRM-20 milling machine node with the default origin 10, 10, 10",
  "Origen x, y, z = 0": "Origin x, y, z = 0",
  "Antes: origin 10, 10, 10": "Before: origin 10, 10, 10",
  "Nodo Roland SRM-20 milling machine con origin 0, 0, 0 y tiempo estimado": "Roland SRM-20 milling machine node with origin 0, 0, 0 and estimated time",
  "Origen en 0": "Origin at 0",
  "Tiempo estimado": "Estimated time",
  "Después: origin 0, 0, 0. El tiempo estimado se calcula solo tras el paso siguiente": "After: origin 0, 0, 0. The estimated time is only calculated after the next step",
  "Vuelve al bloque <strong>mill raster 2D</strong> y pulsa <strong>calculate</strong>.": "Go back to the <strong>mill raster 2D</strong> block and click <strong>calculate</strong>.",
  "mill raster 2D con el botón calculate": "mill raster 2D with the calculate button",
  "Clic en calculate": "Click calculate",
  "mill raster 2D: botón calculate": "mill raster 2D: calculate button",
  "Se abre un render 3D de la placa en una pestaña nueva. Revisa que todo esté en orden y que el corte del contorno esté bien hecho.": "A 3D render of the board opens in a new tab. Check that everything is in order and that the outline cut looks right.",
  "Render 3D del corte del contorno octagonal sobre el stock de cobre": "3D render of the octagonal outline cut on the copper stock",
  "Render: corte del contorno": "Render: outline cut",
  "Regresa a la pestaña de mods y pulsa <strong>save file</strong>. mods lo guarda como <code>SVG image.rml</code>; renómbralo a <code>PERIFERIA.rml</code>. Este es el archivo que se carga para las periferias de la placa en el <strong>vPanel</strong>, el software que controla la MonoFab.": "Go back to the mods tab and click <strong>save file</strong>. mods saves it as <code>SVG image.rml</code>; rename it to <code>PERIFERIA.rml</code>. This is the file loaded for the board outline in <strong>vPanel</strong>, the software that controls the MonoFab.",
  "Nodo save file listo para guardar el archivo": "save file node ready to save the file",
