  "set PCB defaults en mm con 0.40mm flat seleccionado": "set PCB defaults in mm with 0.40mm flat selected",
  "Elegir 0.40mm flat": "Choose 0.40mm flat",
  "set PCB defaults: mm y 0.40mm flat": "set PCB defaults: mm and 0.40mm flat",
  "En <strong>Roland SRM-20 milling machine</strong> pon el <strong>origin</strong> en <code>0, 0, 0</code>. La velocidad se queda en 4 mm/s.": "In <strong>Roland SRM-20 milling machine</strong> set the <strong>origin</strong> to <code>0, 0, 0</code>. The speed stays at 4 mm/s.",
  "Nodo Roland SRM-20 milling machine con origin 0, 0, 0": "Roland SRM-20 milling machine node with origin 0, 0, 0",
  "Roland SRM-20 milling machine: origin 0, 0, 0": "Roland SRM-20 milling machine: origin 0, 0, 0",
  "En <strong>mill raster 2D</strong> comprueba que <strong>offset number</strong> esté en <code>2</code> (con el preset la fresa queda en 0.39624 mm y la profundidad en 0.1016 mm) y pulsa <strong>calculate</strong>.": "In <strong>mill raster 2D</strong> check that <strong>offset number</strong> is <code>2</code> (with the preset the tool is 0.39624 mm and the depth 0.1016 mm) and click <strong>calculate</strong>.",
  "mill raster 2D con offset number 2 y el botón calculate": "mill raster 2D with offset number 2 and the calculate button",
  "mill raster 2D: offset number 2 y calculate": "mill raster 2D: offset number 2 and calculate",
  "Se abre el render 3D. Revisa que las pistas se vean bien aisladas y que sean de cobre.": "The 3D render opens. Check that the tracks look well isolated and that they are copper.",
  "Render 3D del aislamiento de las pistas sobre el stock de cobre": "3D render of the track isolation on the copper stock",
  "Las pistas deben quedar en cobre": "The tracks must be copper",
  "Render: las pistas deben quedar en cobre": "Render: the tracks must be copper",
  "Asegúrate de que en el render las pistas queden de cobre. Si no es así, vuelve a invertir el SVG (botón <b>invert</b> en <b>convert SVG image</b>) y calcula otra vez.": "Make sure the tracks come out as copper in the render. If not, invert the SVG again (<b>invert</b> button in <b>convert SVG image</b>) and calculate again.",
  "Vuelve a mods y pulsa <strong>save file</strong>. Guárdalo como <code>PISTAS.rml</code>.": "Go back to mods and click <strong>save file</strong>. Save it as <code>PISTAS.rml</code>.",
  "Nodo save file listo para guardar el archivo de las pistas": "save file node ready to save the tracks file",
  "ORIFICIOS: taladrado": "ORIFICIOS (holes): drilling",
  "0.79mm drill": "0.79mm drill",
  "0.3 mm/s": "0.3 mm/s",
  "Recarga la página de mods (<code>F5</code>): el grafo vuelve a su estado inicial. En <strong>read SVG</strong> pulsa <strong>select SVG file</strong> y elige el SVG de los orificios (la capa <code>User.4</code> exportada de KiCad).": "Reload the mods page (<code>F5</code>): the graph goes back to its initial state. In <strong>read SVG</strong> click <strong>select SVG file</strong> and choose the holes SVG (the <code>User.4</code> layer exported from KiCad).",
  "Quedan cargados los orificios: en la vista previa se ven los puntos de las perforaciones.": "The holes are loaded: in the preview you can see the drill points.",
  "read SVG con el SVG de los orificios cargado": "read SVG with the holes SVG loaded",
  "Se ven los orificios": "The holes are visible",
  "SVG de los orificios cargado": "Holes SVG loaded",
  "En <strong>set PCB defaults</strong> cambia a <strong>mm</strong> y selecciona <strong>0.79mm drill</strong>.": "In <strong>set PCB defaults</strong> switch to <strong>mm</strong> and select <strong>0.79mm drill</strong>.",
  "set PCB defaults en mm con 0.79mm drill seleccionado": "set PCB defaults in mm with 0.79mm drill selected",
  "Elegir 0.79mm drill": "Choose 0.79mm drill",
  "set PCB defaults: mm y 0.79mm drill": "set PCB defaults: mm and 0.79mm drill",
  "En <strong>Roland SRM-20 milling machine</strong> el <strong>origin</strong> también va en <code>0, 0, 0</code>. Y aquí está la diferencia: <strong>este es el único archivo al que se le cambia la velocidad</strong>. Periferia y pistas siempre van a 4 mm/s; el taladrado va a <code>0.3</code> mm/s. Cambia <strong>speed</strong> de 4 a 0.3.": "In <strong>Roland SRM-20 milling machine</strong> the <strong>origin</strong> is also <code>0, 0, 0</code>. And here is the difference: <strong>this is the only file where the speed is changed</strong>. Outline and tracks always run at 4 mm/s; drilling runs at <code>0.3</code> mm/s. Change <strong>speed</strong> from 4 to 0.3.",
  "Nodo Roland SRM-20 milling machine con speed 4": "Roland SRM-20 milling machine node with speed 4",
  "Cambiar speed a 0.3": "Change speed to 0.3",
  "Antes: speed 4": "Before: speed 4",
  "Nodo Roland SRM-20 milling machine con speed 0.3 y origin 0, 0, 0": "Roland SRM-20 milling machine node with speed 0.3 and origin 0, 0, 0",
  "speed = 0.3": "speed = 0.3",
  "Origen = 0": "Origin = 0",
  "Después: speed 0.3 y origin 0, 0, 0": "After: speed 0.3 and origin 0, 0, 0",
  "Los otros dos archivos van a 4 mm/s. Solo ORIFICIOS lleva speed = 0.3.": "The other two files run at 4 mm/s. Only ORIFICIOS uses speed = 0.3.",
  "En <strong>mill raster 2D</strong> pon <strong>offset number</strong> en <code>1</code> (con el preset la fresa queda en 0.79248 mm, cut depth 0.254 mm y max depth 1.7018 mm) y pulsa <strong>calculate</strong>.": "In <strong>mill raster 2D</strong> set <strong>offset number</strong> to <code>1</code> (with the preset the tool is 0.79248 mm, cut depth 0.254 mm and max depth 1.7018 mm) and click <strong>calculate</strong>.",
  "mill raster 2D con offset number 1 y el botón calculate": "mill raster 2D with offset number 1 and the calculate button",
  "Offset number = 1": "Offset number = 1",
  "mill raster 2D: offset number 1 y calculate": "mill raster 2D: offset number 1 and calculate",
  "En el render comprueba que los orificios se vean bien hechos: deben aparecer las 6 perforaciones.": "In the render check that the holes look properly made: all 6 drill holes should appear.",
  "Render 3D de la placa con las perforaciones marcadas": "3D render of the board with the drill holes marked",
  "Los 6 orificios": "The 6 holes",
